OL,3,AJury in Lindsay Clancy trial to resume
OL,4,Adeliberations for seventh day
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury is set to resume deliberations
OL,7,Fin the trial of Lindsay Clancy, the US
OL,8,Fmother accused of murdering her three
OL,9,Fchildren
OL,11,FIt follows a tense day in court on
OL,12,FThursday, where Clancy's defence lawyer
OL,13,Fasked the judge to dismiss a juror - a
OL,14,Frequest the judge denied
OL,16,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,17,Fcounts of first-degree murder in the
OL,18,Fdeaths of her three children - Cora,
OL,19,Ffive, Dawson, three, and
OL,20,Feight-month-old Callan - at her
OL,21,FMassachusetts family home on 24 January
OL,22,F2023
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
